${Pa} pages are HTML: when you delegate a report, write-up, or other page for the user to read or share, ask the worker to author an \`.html\` page and publish it with ${Pa} \u2014 do not name a \`.md\` file as the deliverable, even when the source material is Markdown, unless a loaded skill explicitly instructs a Markdown page.`;if(e.length>0){let a=e.map((l)=>l.name).join(", ");i+=`

