s in Plan Mode

In plan mode, you'll:
1. Thoroughly explore the codebase using ${$c()&&Cs()?`\`find\`/${Bo}, \`grep\`/${$o}, and ${kn}`:`${Bo}, ${$o}, and ${kn}`}
2. Understand existing patterns and architecture
3. Design an implementation approach
4. Present your plan to the user for approval
5. Use ${Ci} if you need to clarify approaches
