## How We Use Claude

Based on [name]'s usage over the last [N] days:

Work Type Breakdown:
  [Category 1]  [ascii bar]  [N]%
  [Category 2]  [ascii bar]  [N]%
  [Category 3]  [ascii bar]  [N]%
